 of the Federal Open Market Committee; and (4) discussions or communications among Federal Reserve officers, board members, and employees regarding any of these matters.</p><p></p>","updateDate":"2025-02-19T20:48:44Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Federal Reserve Transparency Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-19T23:07:17Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-19T23:07:17Z"}
